      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 1</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai26/renshuuC-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000011111.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">①<u>お花見</u>は どうでしたか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Buổi ngắm hoa thế nào rồi?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">とても <ruby>楽<rp>(</rp><rt>たの</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しかったです。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Rất là vui.</div></div></div><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">どうして <ruby>来<rp>(</rp><rt>こ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>なかったんですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Sao bạn không đến vậy?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">②<u><ruby>忙<rp>(</rp><rt>いそが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しかった</u>んです。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Vì tôi bận rồi.</div></div></div></td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p> <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 128);\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span><strong>Luyện tập: </strong></span></span></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:12px;\"><em><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">[thay thế vị trí gạch chân bằng nội dung bên dưới]</span></em></span></p> <p> <span>1)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>社員<rp>(</rp><rt>しゃいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>旅行<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></p> <p> ② ちょっと <ruby>用事<rp>(</rp><rt>ようじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が ありました</p> <p> <span>2)</span></p> <p> ① <ruby>盆<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>踊<rp>(</rp><rt>おど</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>り</p> <p> ② <ruby>体<rp>(</rp><rt>からだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>調子<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かったです</p> <p> </p></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"slide\"><div class=\"slide-title\"><span>Mẫu đàm thoại 2</span></div><div class=\"slide-content\"><p></p> <p> <img decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/minnamoi/bai26/renshuuC-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; \"></p> <p> <audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnarenshuc/10000100000.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"khung\" style=\" width: 100%;\"> <tbody> <tr> <td style=\"width: 60px;\"> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>A:</span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">すてきな ①<u><ruby>帽子<rp>(</rp><rt>ぼうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby></u>ですね。どこで <ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ったんですか。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Cái mũ tuyệt quá. Bạn mua ở đâu vậy?</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>B: </span></strong></span></td> <td> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\">これですか。エドヤストアで <ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Cái này à? Tôi mua ở cửa hàng Edoya đó.</div></div></div></td> </tr> <tr> <td> <span style=\"color:#000080;\"><strong><span>